Package: DPcircular
Type: Package
Title: Circular Sequence Detection via DP
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-04-10
Author: Meng Li
Maintainer: Meng Li <limeng49631@aliyun.com>
Description: Detects circular sequences in DNA/RNA using a modified
    Smith-Waterman local alignment algorithm. Provides circular detection,
    consensus generation, and dotplot visualization utilities.
